data: {"id": "f1770ed6550047b0-thinking-parallel_evidence-889", "run_id": "f1770ed6550047b0", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 证据结论\n\n**已确认事实：**\n1.  **身份与生命周期**：Pod `aiops-case-v10/workload` (UID: `d3e0dc86-6f8b-4f29-a50c-826bf2a1f1e6`) 当前处于 **CrashLoopBackOff** 状态。容器 `app` 已重启 **9** 次，QoS 类为 `Burstable`。\n2.  **终止原因 (Last State)**：上一次容器终止原因为 **Error**，退出码为 **78**。\n3.  **崩溃前日志**：Previous 和当前日志一致，均明确输出 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG environment variable is missing`。\n4.  **配置缺陷**：Pod YAML 显示 `Environment: <none>`，容器内未注入 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 环境变量。\n5.  **代码逻辑验证**：`kubectl get yaml` 中的 `Command` 证实，应用启动时检查该环境变量，若缺失则打印错误信息并以 `sys.ex", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789141354502, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

